<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 127,600 MT slid 41 percent below the previous week, but were 18 percent above the 4-week average.  The major increases were for China (50,000 MT), the Philippines (27,500 MT), the United Kingdom (11,500 MT), and the Dominican Republic (8,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 84,300 MT were one-tenth below the previous week and one-third below the 4-week average.  Indonesia (28,000 MT), the Dominican Republic (16,200 MT), Canada (12,000 MT), and the United Kingdom (11,500 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
